Package: casos
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Manerba <https://github.com/Manerba>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, sqlite3
Section: web
Priority: optional
Description: Casos - self-hosted Issue system
 Flat Issues with Markdown updates, local attachments, image and MSG previews,
 LDAP authentication, mail notifications and MCP access.
 Settings are integrated into the main web application.
